      "value": "Just a volume slider for individual people would work well. What about people who perform, playing music on the stage, or my friends who every one in a while, play a meme through their soundboard (not spamming, but your suggestion would count that the same way)\n\nI don't like an idea of an auto kick system just based on someone's mic.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
